{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11411050","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11411050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1141105001:1":{"text":"사막에선 바오밥 열매가 꽤 맛있었어요... 루몬트는요? 좋아하는 음식 있어요?","source_cn":"说到吃的话，沙漠里的旅人树果还不错……噜噜呢？有爱吃的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CBE77A3B2DBF96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141105002:1":{"text":"네? 저요? 음... 좋아하는 음식은 많은데, 갑자기 이야기하려니까 생각이 안 나네요.","source_cn":"什么？我？唔……喜欢吃的特别多，但一时间脑子想不起来几个了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF7D2246EE54B6E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141105003:1":{"text":"저는 가끔 입이 심심해서 뭔가를 먹고 싶기는 한데, 뭘 먹어야 할지 결정 못 할 때가 많아요...","source_cn":"我经常会有这种时候，就是特别想吃点什么来解馋，但就是没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26CE2B13BBCDCAC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141105004:1":{"text":"후... 가끔은 너무 급하게 결정하는 바람에 아무런 만족감을 못 느낄 때도 있었어요.","source_cn":"呼，有时候着急决定，结果吃到嘴里的时候也根本没什么满足感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9052DEA0FC66C38C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1141105004":{"text":"후... 가끔은 너무 급하게 결정하는 바람에 아무런 만족감을 못 느낄 때도 있었어요.","source_cn":"呼，有时候着急决定，结果吃到嘴里的时候也根本没什么满足感。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9052DEA0FC66C38C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1141105005:1":{"text":"와, 제 말에 공감해 주시다니, 정말 다행이에요!","source_cn":"啊，你能明白我说的真是太好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDF47C8993F4A8C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141105007:1":{"text":"저는 전투가 끝나고 나면 항상 맛있는 음식을 먹어요. 수고한 자신에게 주는 선물인 셈이죠.","source_cn":"每次战斗后，我都会好好犒劳自己，好吃的对噜噜来说就是最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE62ABBACBA9C6770","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141105008:1":{"text":"마스터! 루몬트에게 다른 지역의 음식을 추천해 줄까요?","source_cn":"主人，也许我们可以推荐噜噜点其他区域的美食？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF426F2858E137DC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터! 루몬트에게 다른 지역의 음식을 추천해 줄까요?","female":"마스터! 루몬트에게 다른 지역의 음식을 추천해 줄까요?","variant_male_record_index":"126750","variant_female_record_index":"126751","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1141105008":{"text":"마스터! 루몬트에게 다른 지역의 음식을 추천해 줄까요?","source_cn":"主人，也许我们可以推荐噜噜点其他区域的美食？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCF426F2858E137DC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터! 루몬트에게 다른 지역의 음식을 추천해 줄까요?","female":"마스터! 루몬트에게 다른 지역의 음식을 추천해 줄까요?","variant_male_record_index":"126750","variant_female_record_index":"126751","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1141105009:1":{"t